  "seasonal": {
    "GL": {
      "nov": "A quieter Arctic month for northern lights, indoor arts and local culture. Polar darkness has begun in northern communities while southern towns retain short daylight. First Advent falls on November 29 in 2026; local tree-lighting arrangements need confirmation.",
